# The hypothesis log is append-only: every researcher adds entries at the end, and main
# gains entries too. A normal merge would conflict on that. "union" keeps both sides.
HYPOTHESIS_LOG.md merge=union

# Binary deliverables must never get EOL conversion or text treatment. Some PDFs (e.g.
# reportlab output) contain no NUL byte, so git's auto-detection wrongly treats them as
# text and autocrlf can corrupt them. Mark them binary explicitly.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
